
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Employee Attendance System</title>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/html5-qrcode"></script>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<header>
 <h2>📋 Attendance System</h2>
 <p>Employee Attendance Monitoring Dashboard</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

 <div class="stats">
  <div class="card">
   <small>Total Employees</small>
   <div class="stat blue" id="total">0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
   <small>Time In Today</small>
   <div class="stat green" id="present">0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
   <small>Time Out Today</small>
   <div class="stat orange" id="out">0</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
   <small>Not Yet Out</small>
   <div class="stat red" id="pending">0</div>
  </div>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>➕ Register Employee</h3>
  <input id="empid" placeholder="Employee ID">
  <input id="empname" placeholder="Employee Name">
  <button onclick="addEmployee()">Add Employee</button>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>🕘 Manual Time In (Admin)</h3>
  <select id="inEmployee"></select>
  <button class="greenbtn" onclick="timeIn()">Record Time In</button>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>🔳 Employee QR Code</h3>
  <select id="qrEmployee" onchange="makeQR()"></select>
  <div id="qrcode"></div>
  <p class="note">I-print o i-save ang QR code ng employee. Gagamitin ito sa pag-time out.</p>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>📷 QR Scanner (Time Out)</h3>
  <div id="reader"></div>
  <button class="darkbtn" onclick="startScanner()">Start QR Scanner</button>
  <button onclick="stopScanner()">Stop Scanner</button>
  <p class="note">Payagan ang camera access kapag tinanong ng browser.</p>
  <p id="scanmessage"></p>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>👥 Employee List</h3>
  <div id="employees"></div>
 </div>

 <div class="card">
  <h3>📊 Today's Attendance</h3>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto">
   <table>
    <thead>
     <tr>
      <th>Employee</th>
      <th>Time In</th>
      <th>Time Out</th>
     </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="records"></tbody>
   </table>
  </div>
 </div>

 <p class="note">
  Prototype version. Data is saved only in this browser on this device.
  For a shared company system, we will add a PHP and MySQL database later.
 </p>

</div>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
